      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Small slide\nHigh vantage point lookout\nfor easier finding your toy\nbut exposed you easy",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "4CwKUiL-7IR6-B0DXng9Q",
      "originalText": "Small slide\nHigh vantage point lookout for easier finding your toy but exposed you easy",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "05HFoNZL3yJWJgJvHbH0n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -792.365889936139,
      "y": 928.7386471736968,
      "width": 2152.127197265625,
      "height": 636.9705876158631,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 659697403,
      "version": 1070,
      "versionNonce": 1627424309,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1768248628678,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Abilities:\n*Loud toy: This makes sound and lures the caretakers to it. It has a radius of about in this\nscale of 5 squares (or 5 meters) and will only lure the closest caretaker to its location.\nOnce the caretaker gets to the toy they will pick it up and fiddle with it to turn it off.\nThis will take 3 seconds during which time they will no longer notice anything around them.\n\n*Armors arrow: Can be used to shoot at a caretaker who then will run to the first other caretaker\nthey see and talk with them distracting both for 2 seconds or if both get shot they will be distracted\nfor 6 seconds. (Very strong will have few arrows to balance)\n\n*Baby powder: Can be used similar to a smoke bomb will obstruct the view of both the caretaker and \nthe player in an 3 meter circle area for 3 seconds.",
      "fontSize": 42.464705841057544,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Abilities:\n*Loud toy: This makes sound and lures the caretakers to it. It has a radius of about in this\nscale of 5 squares (or 5 meters) and will only lure the closest caretaker to its location.\nOnce the caretaker gets to the toy they will pick it up and fiddle with it to turn it off.\nThis will take 3 seconds during which time they will no longer notice anything around them.\n\n*Armors arrow: Can be used to shoot at a caretaker who then will run to the first other caretaker\nthey see and talk with them distracting both for 2 seconds or if both get shot they will be distracted\nfor 6 seconds. (Very strong will have few arrows to balance)\n\n*Baby powder: Can be used similar to a smoke bomb will obstruct the view of both the caretaker and \nthe player in an 3 meter circle area for 3 seconds.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
