      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1768248815578,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reveal 2:\nThen when you were able to match all the caretakers to the right partners you feel happy and satisfied \nwith your work. Then you suddenly feel tired and your eyes seems to close so you open them again and\nrub them with your tiny hands and notice that it was all a dream when you fell asleep with your\nfavorite toy the white and pink bow and arrows.",
      "fontSize": 46.39766710616928,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reveal 2:\nThen when you were able to match all the caretakers to the right partners you feel happy and satisfied \nwith your work. Then you suddenly feel tired and your eyes seems to close so you open them again and\nrub them with your tiny hands and notice that it was all a dream when you fell asleep with your\nfavorite toy the white and pink bow and arrows.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
